			"notes": "### Key Changes & Features\n- **Version Port:** Successfully ported the core logic to Minecraft 1.21.1.\n- **Architectury Migration:** The mod now uses the Architectury API, allowing for a single codebase for both Fabric and NeoForge.\n- **Milk Regeneration:** Added a new survival mechanic — players now regenerate one level of milk every 30 seconds.\n- **Creative Mode Tweaks:** Removed the milking cooldown while in Creative mode for better testing and building.\n- **Really Immortal** Immortal players (those in Creative or with invulnerability) can no longer be milked by others.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n-  Armor Exploit: Fixed a bug where wearing armor could prevent a player's death even after their milk supply was completely exhausted."
